              "params": {
                "text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:1.5em;\"><strong>INFORMATION TEXT (Part 2)</strong></span></p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "55aaf4d3-f7e3-4a3e-9196-01a6f7474f94"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582782,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Odoacer's Reign</strong><br>\nAs the King of Italy, Odoacer ruled for nearly 17 years. His reign was marked by attempts to preserve Roman traditions and institutions. He maintained a Roman style of governance and continued to issue coins with the effigies of the Eastern Roman Emperors to show his allegiance.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Relations with the Eastern Empire</strong><br>\nOdoacer pledged his loyalty to the Eastern Roman Emperor and received formal recognition of his rule in return. However, the relationship between Odoacer and the Eastern Empire was complicated by power struggles and mistrust. Odoacer's autonomous rule in Italy was seen with suspicion by Constantinople.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Challenges to Power</strong><br>\nOdoacer faced constant challenges to his rule from both within and outside Italy. He battled other barbarian groups and faced opposition from aristocrats who were loyal to the old Roman ways. These challenges often resulted in military conflicts and political maneuvers to maintain his dominance.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "3b13867b-feab-4e2e-bfa2-fcc82e4dbff1"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
